                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'key': 'The whole question is **time apportionment on a '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'change of membership**. Dejo was a partner for '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            '**5 of the 12 months** and Dandy for the other '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            '**7**, so each of their three entitlements — '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'salary, interest on capital and share of profit '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            '— is scaled by 5/12 and 7/12 respectively. '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'Akanbi and David were partners throughout, so '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'they take their full entitlements. The four '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'shares of profit add back to exactly '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            '**N2,400,000**, which is the check that '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'confirms the apportionment.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'note': 'Dandy takes "the sharing ratio which Dejo used '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'to enjoy" — **1 of the 4 parts** in the 1 : 2 '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             ': 1 ratio, or one quarter. So the quarter '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'share is itself split 5/12 : 7/12 between Dejo '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'and Dandy, while Akanbi\'s half and David\'s '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'quarter are undisturbed.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'note': 'The **2024 and 2025 adjusted profits are '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'noise**. The 2027 year of assessment is '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'assessed on the **preceding year basis**, so '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'its basis period is the year ended 31 December '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             '**2026**, and only the N2,400,000 is relevant. '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'The earlier figures are there to tempt a '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'candidate into averaging, or into applying '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'commencement rules that §17.4 expressly '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'switches off.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'key': 'Note what does **not** happen: the partnership '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'is **not** treated as having ceased and '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'recommenced when Dejo left and Dandy joined. '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'Section 25 of the NTA (§17.4) provides that an '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'individual is not treated as commencing or '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'ceasing a trade merely by becoming or ceasing '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'to be a partner, where the nature of the trade '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'is unchanged. The cessation-and-recommencement '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'fiction in paragraph 19(b) of the First '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'Schedule (§17.7) applies only for the purpose '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'of **recomputing capital allowances**, which '
                                                                                                                                                                                                            'this question does not ask for.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'h4': '2(b)  Commencement of a new trade — section '
                                                                                                                                                                                                           '22(2) of NTA',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'p': 'The assessable income of an individual from a '
                                                                                                                                                                                                          'trade, business, profession or vocation carried '
                                                                                                                                                                                                          'on by him in Nigeria, for the year of assessment '
                                                                                                                                                                                                          'in which he commenced, and for the two following '
                                                                                                                                                                                                          'years of assessment (referred to as "the first '
                                                                                                                                                                                                          'year", "the second year" and "the third year"), '
                                                                                                                                                                                                          'shall be ascertained in accordance with the '
                                                                                                                                                                                                          'following provisions:',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'ol': [
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'for the **first year**, the assessable income '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'shall be the income **from the date on which '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'the individual commenced** such trade, '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'business, profession or vocation in Nigeria '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          '**to the end of its first accounting period**;',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'for the **second year**, the assessable income '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'shall be the income **from the first day after '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'the first accounting period to the end of its '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'second accounting period**; and',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'for the **third year, and each subsequent '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'year** thereafter, the assessable income shall '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'be the profits **from the day after the '
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                          'accounting period just ended**.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                        ],
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
                                                                                                                                                              {
                                                                                                                                                                                                     'note': 'These are the **actual-basis** commencement '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'rules: the first three years are assessed on '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'the income of the accounting periods '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'themselves rather than on a preceding-year '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'basis, so that no period of profit escapes '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'assessment and none is assessed twice. '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'Question 2 of Chapter 16 (§16.11) and Question '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             '1 of Chapter 15 (§15.13) both apply the same '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'rules to capital allowances and chargeable '
                                                                                                                                                                                                             'profits.',
                                                                                                                                                                                                   },
